      "index": "ax",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 268146944,
      "version": 999,
      "versionNonce": 113498368,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791895102424,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Workers pick an event from the topic queue and\nmark an entry in cache for \"im working on this noti\"\nIf somebody else has already picked it up,\nthe worker simply drops it and moves on.\n\n- Workers retry with EB + Jitter\nto prevent 429s or thundering herd\non TPTs.\n\n- Max Allowed attempts: configurable default 5\nafter that, they are put in DLQs & removed from cache.\n\n- Worker pools can be scaled separately for each topic\nwhenever needed to prevent Kafka getting hammered from svc side.",
      "fontSize": 18.867597367702203,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Workers pick an event from the topic queue and\nmark an entry in cache for \"im working on this noti\"\nIf somebody else has already picked it up,\nthe worker simply drops it and moves on.\n\n- Workers retry with EB + Jitter\nto prevent 429s or thundering herd\non TPTs.\n\n- Max Allowed attempts: configurable default 5\nafter that, they are put in DLQs & removed from cache.\n\n- Worker pools can be scaled separately for each topic\nwhenever needed to prevent Kafka getting hammered from svc side.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
